<title>USA: New Haven mayor says Moody's upgrades bond rating.</title>
<headline>New Haven mayor says Moody's upgrades bond rating.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HAVEN, Conn. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The city of New Haven won a bond upgrading from Moody's Investors Service to Baa1 from Baa, New Haven Mayor John DeStefano, Jr. said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The move positioned the city one step away from an &quot;A&quot; rating, DeStefano said in a statement.</p>
<p>He said this was a signal that New Haven's management, financial practices and economic condition have greatly improved over the past three years.</p>
</text>
